re><figure><img alt=\"冷氣機｜家中空調是時候要清洗嗎？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220524/605731174337482752671983.jpeg/jdJ92X2Y0yh0Sg2y24logTDk234NhVX4Tl-yBU5fsgU\"/><figcaption>冷氣機｜家中空調是時候要清洗嗎？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"冷氣機｜家中空調是時候要清洗嗎？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220524/605731177181351936693847.jpeg/HlgVfgqCfOOZwJ_1CYdLU4DrthVcPT8MNgQOfzYEDn8\"/><figcaption>冷氣機｜家中空調是時候要清洗嗎？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文經《風傳媒》授權轉載，原文：別只知道按舒眠模式！吹冷氣按「這1個按鈕」省電又舒服，網大讚：長知識了】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-16T02:18:45.154681+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1225,"images":25,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}